#
# The login program (gettytab lo=) of getty_test's line: a plain
# interactive sh(1) on the terminal getty opened, with no profile that reads
# the terminal (resizewin) or line editor that discards typed-ahead input,
# so the test can type on the line as soon as getty has written to it.  It
# ends the session when it exits, as a login does.
exec /bin/sh -i
